{
  "html": "\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\" id=\"cw-layout-magazine\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: #eee7f2; box-sizing: border-box; color: #3b2d45; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 26px 24px; width: 100%; word-break: break-word\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #3b2d45; margin: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #3b2d45; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 0 26px; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 40px 0 32px; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003csection\u003e\u003cp style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; color: #3b2d45; display: block; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; text-align: left; width: auto\"\u003e一抹克制的丁香紫铺开在卷首，既有法式时装刊的摩登优雅，又保留了温柔轻盈的呼吸感。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 40px 0 0 auto; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 12px 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; color: #3b2d45; display: block; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 0 0 16px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e低饱和紫调的高级时尚感\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #3b2d45; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\"\u003e淡紫满幅导语块柔和定调，搭配干净精致的章节层级，让美妆、香氛与生活方式图文自带杂志光泽。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; border-right: 1px solid #70417d; color: #3b2d45; font-size: 24px; font-style: italic; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.85; margin: 24px 0; padding: 16px 20px; text-align: right\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\"\u003e优雅从来不是用力过猛，而是恰到好处的克制与留白。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 24px 0 0; text-align: left\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/botanical-leaves.jpg\" alt=\"晨光壁面与清雅玻璃花瓶绿植\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"background-color: #e0d2e6; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 40px 0 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 28px 18px; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; color: #3b2d45; display: block; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 0 0 16px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e时尚生活刊的编排特点\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 22px\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e低饱和丁香紫区别于常见粉红少女风\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e适合穿搭画报、香评与女性人物专访\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e柔雅配色长时间阅读舒适不刺眼\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #75627e; color: #3b2d45; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 32px 0 0; padding: 18px 0 0; text-align: left\"\u003e把每一次认真生活，都过成值得珍藏的封面故事。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e",
